NAME: Blackjack

DESCRIPTION:

Play Blackjack against the computer.
The computer is the dealer.

You start with 200. Bet in steps of 10,
then tap Deal.

On your turn:
- Hit     take another card
- Stand   keep your total
- Double  double the bet & take one card

Dealer stands on 17.  
Blackjack pays 3 to 2.

Tap Reset Bank when you are out of chips.

NOTES:

Developed by AI.
